{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you have to kill giants to collect their core. To do that, you can build huge walking fortresses and attach weapons on them.\u00a0 <br>To power these fortresses, you need to craft energy cubes, keep in mind the enemies wont let you get the materials without a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Walking platforms</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your base to allow it to walk or even fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/walk_5m.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Giant bosses</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of these bosses can only be defeated with a base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/boss.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Explore</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your time to explore the vast world of Loya!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/procedural_5m.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Towers</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add defenses to your base by placing towers that automatically attack enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/towers_optim600.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Building</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to make your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/build_optim600.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Combat</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 4 distinct classes that you can unlock in the altar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/war_ult_optimize600.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Energy</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every machine in Loya needs energy to function. Use wind turbines and batteries to manage your energy supply. Be careful though, your base can only handle so much weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/energy_optim600.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends in friend only games or join a dedicated server! The servers are optimized to handle up to 25 players! (It could handle more but I never tested it)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Other features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quests with procedural rewards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Villages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capturable/Mountable pets</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2271150?t=1746960295","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/99305e87284e15e13360df72660d1cbb69b4d40f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746960295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/1d8f84acabc7693bbff482026cd649a467fb67c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746960295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/