tack enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/towers_optim600.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Building</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to make your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/build_optim600.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Combat</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 4 distinct classes that you can unlock in the altar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/war_ult_optimize600.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Energy</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every machine in Loya needs energy to function. Use wind turbines and batteries to manage your energy supply. Be careful though, your base can only handle so much weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/energy_optim600.gif?t=1746960295\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends in friend only games or join a dedicated server! The servers are optimized to handle up to 25 players! (It could handle more but I never tested it)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Other features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quests with procedural rewards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Villages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capturable/